flowchart LR
    R[Resident browser]
    S[Staff / Admin browser]
    N[Nginx web server]
    V[Vite-built CSS and JavaScript]
    L[Laravel 12 application]
    MW[Authentication, role, verification, validation, throttling]
    C[Controllers]
    M[Eloquent models]
    DB[(MySQL database)]
    MAIL[Configured mail transport]

    R --> N
    S --> N
    N -->|Static assets| V
    N -->|Application requests| L
    L --> MW --> C --> M --> DB
    C -->|Password reset notification| MAIL
    L -->|Blade HTML response| N
